{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1772847720,"nonce":"hrjexkndfMy98FpZo5RrFGfn050=","title":"Console rich view shows \"No events\": historical stream events not loaded on mount","message":"When switching to rich view in the Console tab, the event list shows \"No events\" because the component does not fetch historical stream events on mount — only new SSE events are streamed going forward. Fixed by PtySession.getStreamEvents(), a /api/console/sessions/:id/stream-events endpoint, and a history-fetch effect in TerminalPane that fires on sessionId change.","files":null}]}